                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a1b416f5-28a1-4775-a55c-320556bf41fa",
                        "entry_id": "faebff37-3652-3184-90ec-2e6a515a586c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "са́льниках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dedf807a-d194-3158-bf97-bffa304fbfad",
                        "entry_id": "faebff37-3652-3184-90ec-2e6a515a586c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. устройство для герметизации отверстий, через которые проходят подвижные части механизмов — валы, штоки и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab314c5d-67fe-4294-9981-b8c4fc010d30",
                                "sense_id": "dedf807a-d194-3158-bf97-bffa304fbfad",
                                "text": "Как показывает практика, в конструкции амортизаторов наиболее часто выходят из строя либо клапанный механизм, либо сальник штока."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8aca4da0-8412-49df-a2e6-6407ce8e8359",
                                "sense_id": "dedf807a-d194-3158-bf97-bffa304fbfad",
                                "text": "Если есть следы утечки, подтяните верхнюю крышку картера рулевого механизма и/или замените сальники валов червяка и сошки."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "398f9acb-f32f-447d-b6b9-f6beeaa18248",
                                "sense_id": "dedf807a-d194-3158-bf97-bffa304fbfad",
                                "text": "Все валы уплотнены резиновыми самоподжимными манжетными сальниками."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d2d5ad5c-84c6-44ed-aa18-b914d02553d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "faebff37-3652-3184-90ec-2e6a515a586c",
                        "source_sense_id": "dedf807a-d194-3158-bf97-bffa304fbfad",
                        "target_lang_word": "stuffing box",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stuffing box",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f71128a1-7001-3eea-946b-b8c9d9c82439",
                                        "entry_id": "4aeb1156-57db-3fd5-bcd2-e372ef58f8eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An assembly containing a seal, or sealing material, around a shaft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e8c940d-0329-4b65-b6fb-11481ec44af3",
                                                "sense_id": "f71128a1-7001-3eea-946b-b8c9d9c82439",
                                                "text": "Packing in the stuffing-boxes, through which the piston-rods pass at the end of the cylinder, and so arranged to keep the cylinders steam-tight, at times become loose or displaced, and in such conditions steam may pass with considerable violence out of the cylinder by way of the stuffing-box, giving an acoustic effect somewhat resembling that of an engine with cylinder-cocks open, except that the noise heard is intermittent and not practically continuous, as when the cylinder cocks are open."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ddf4c8e-721e-4209-b408-b3e2406cf1f1",
                                                "sense_id": "f71128a1-7001-3eea-946b-b8c9d9c82439",
                                                "text": "The regulator in the dome is of the vertical grid type, operated by an external pull rod connected to a transverse shaft which works through a stuffing box on the second barrel plate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3805ab3f-5d44-4b60-9991-b13f56ab1f96",
                        "source_entry_id": "faebff37-3652-3184-90ec-2e6a515a586c",
                        "source_sense_id": "dedf807a-d194-3158-bf97-bffa304fbfad",
                        "target_lang_word": "gasket",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gasket",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4e9fdde-3e66-32ac-af5e-5b40125031e2",
                                        "entry_id": "2521b42f-659c-3d78-8bb5-2b9d9d50e2bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A length of rope or canvas band used for reefing a sail, or holding a stowed sail in place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0213d679-e48c-3c8e-82f1-852dc31a9b3d",
                                        "entry_id": "2521b42f-659c-3d78-8bb5-2b9d9d50e2bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any mechanical seal that serves to fill the space between two objects, generally to prevent leakage between the two objects while under compression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "347f0454-6a96-4e60-a2ae-b89929a4241b",
                                                "sense_id": "0213d679-e48c-3c8e-82f1-852dc31a9b3d",
                                                "text": "Three major types of oil-pan gaskets are available: cork/ neoprene composition, neoprene and Hypalon Duraprene. Most professionals prefer cork/neoprene gaskets because the oil-pan bolts seem to lose their torque with the others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0f122f5-ec5a-3db3-a4c0-f6ddb61d399a",
                                        "entry_id": "2521b42f-659c-3d78-8bb5-2b9d9d50e2bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A material which may be clamped between faces and acts as a static seal. Gaskets may be cut, formed, or molded to the desired configuration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca3f7e8f-f3da-3a1f-8000-9a9c9083d439",
                                        "entry_id": "2521b42f-659c-3d78-8bb5-2b9d9d50e2bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a wide variety of seals or packings used between matched machine parts or around pipe joints to prevent the escape of a gas or fluid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gasket",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fa297ef-c731-3089-9748-af0f0238d3ec",
